{"about_the_game":"Tower of Magic is kind of a childhood memory for post-90s/00s, I guess, my earliest exposure to the game was Tower of Mordor, that's why I want to make a Tower of Magic game<br>Adding the now popular Roguelike element, adding randomness to each area based on the reasonably planned route of the Magic Tower game, so what does certainty plus uncertainty equal?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50 Five regions, over 150 maps, experience hundreds of gear &amp; skill combinations</h2>         Plan your route through the area, defeat enemies as harmlessly as possible, defeat the boss, move on to the next area, and pick the area rewards<br>         Use different equipment skill sets to defeat different enemies depending on their characteristics!<br>         Occasionally, we come across the odd map<br>         After passing the level, you can challenge the high difficulty dungeon, the road to become a big man of the Magic Tower<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50 Eight characters, eleven professions</h2>          Enjoy the Assassin Attack Stream, Knight Defense Stream, Wizard Spell Stream, Sacrifice Stream, Attack Speed Stream, and many other superb ways to play!<br>          Black out <strong>the character</strong> and experience the character's great power as well as control the great power side effects<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50Multiple DLCs available during the course of the game</h2>          Turn on skill tree mode<br>          Embark on an endless journey<br>          Open the Volcano/Sky City map<br>          ......<br>          Start enjoying a trip to the Magic Tower dungeon!<br><br><br>Benefits of Steam version vs. Android version.<br>\u24606000 souls<br>\u2461200% in-game soul acquisition<br>\u2462 Steam Ring [Ex]<br>\u2463 The Demon King's Treasure DLC direct access","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u6fc0\u6218\u9b54\u738b\uff0c\u52c7\u593a\u80dc\u5229","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1725950/3a7a5dbcd0604c